196
00:07:48,232 --> 00:07:51,127
and the cargo area is sixteen point

197
00:07:51,127 --> 00:07:52,534
seven cubic feet.

198
00:07:52,714 --> 00:07:54,962
The reviewer calls it a real trunk

199
00:07:54,962 --> 00:07:56,615
