220
00:08:43,517 --> 00:08:45,301
Kerb weight two thousand,

221
00:08:45,301 --> 00:08:47,443
one hundred seventy kilograms,

222
00:08:47,443 --> 00:08:50,726
which is forty-seven eighty-four pounds by our

223
00:08:50,726 --> 00:08:53,652
