00:08:58,800 --> 00:09:00,206
fifty-one rear.

227
00:09:00,556 --> 00:09:01,798
By our arithmetic,

228
00:09:01,798 --> 00:09:05,176
seven hundred fifteen horsepower on two thousand,

229
00:09:05,176 --> 00:09:08,210
one hundred seventy kilograms is about three

230
00:09:08,210 --> 00:09:10,692
hundred thirty horsepower per tonne.

231
00:09:10,872 --> 00:09:14,014
Motor1 describes the car as handling more

232
00:09:14,014 --> 00:09:15,547
like a sports sedan,

233
00:09:15,547 --> 00:09:17,463
and the Ferrari's V12 is,

234
00:09:17,463 --> 00:09:19,303
