00:10:33,215 --> 00:10:36,573
and Wikipedia's power peak is at seventy-seven

265
00:10:36,573 --> 00:10:37,011
fifty.

266
00:10:37,191 --> 00:10:38,400
By our arithmetic,

267
00:10:38,400 --> 00:10:41,088
that leaves five hundred rpm between the

