269
00:10:43,252 --> 00:10:45,888
Prices conflict, so we list them.

270
00:10:46,068 --> 00:10:49,444
Robb Report: three hundred ninety thousand euros,

271
00:10:49,444 --> 00:10:52,337
about four hundred three thousand dollars.

272
00:10:52,517 --> 00:10:55,707
